# The screenshots stay local to a checkout rather than being committed.
#
# docs/LEGAL.md rule 1 is "no original assets in-repo", and a screenshot of
# the running client embeds its UI artwork and its server's branding. The
# project's existing precedent agrees: REFERENCE_GAPS.md describes reference
# screenshots in prose and commits none of them.
#
# README.md in this directory is the catalogue and IS committed, so the
# filenames below are stable and can be referenced from the docs. Drop the
# PNGs in here and they line up.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
